### The Real Challenge

**Can you make ORBIT-X fail in a way its programming logic wasn't prepared for?**

The purpose isn't just to launch a spacecraft successfully.

It's to understand how engineering systems make decisions, respond to failures, and recover from unexpected situations.

**Experiment. Break things. Understand why. Improve the system.**

*ORBIT-X is an educational C simulation with simplified spacecraft physics and predefined safety rules. It is not real aerospace flight-control software.*
